{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21285","headline":"宪宗章武孝皇帝挽歌词三首 二 · 元稹","name":"宪宗章武孝皇帝挽歌词三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天宝遗余事，元和盛圣功。\n二凶枭帐下，三叛斩都中。\n始服沙陁虏，方吞逻逤戎。\n狼星如要射，犹有鼎湖弓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}